          "quote_count": 0,
          "reply_count": 1,
          "retweet_count": 0
        },
        "text": "Chaos is not a rush. You wait until one enemy unit is out of place, then make the rest of the fight an answer to that.",
        "url": "https://x.com/Heroes0fcrypto/status/2110882073452167680"
      },
      {
