        "referenced_tweets": [
          {
            "id": "2110730873159168376",
            "type": "replied_to"
          }
        ],
        "text": "Why that glance matters more once the map starts shrinking: https://t.co/pxHT7Vw6Wk",
        "url": "https://x.com/Heroes0fcrypto/status/2110730955853861001"
      },
      {
        "author_id": "1768370292353884160",
        "created_at": "2026-10-15T13:53:50.000Z",
        "id": "2110730873159168376",
        "public_metrics": {
          "bookmark_count": 0,
          "impression_count": 17,
          "like_count": 0,
          "quote_count": 0,
          "reply_count": 1,
          "retweet_count": 0
        },
        "text": "If the unit you want to hit acts before the unit you are sending, the plan is already late. Read the queue before you commit. https://t.co/1eQJpPNHH2",
        "url": "https://x.com/Heroes0fcrypto/status/2110730873159168376"
      },
      {
        "author_id": "1768370292353884160",
        "created_at": "2026-10-15T03:03:53.000Z",
        "id": "2110567307013726582",
        "public_metrics": {
          "bookmark_count": 0,
          "impression_count": 60,
          "like_count": 2,
          "quote_count": 0,
          "reply_count": 1,
          "retweet_count": 0
        },
        "text": "We grew up on Heroes III. The battles were the best part, and the map kept making us wait.\n\nSo we built only the battle: turn-based PvP against real players. The board shrinks every few laps, so nobody hides.\n\nFree in the browser.\n\nhttps://t.co/EENa0HvsTL https://t.co/Orq3JKXb6p",
        "url": "https://x.com/Heroes0fcrypto/status/2110567307013726582"
      }
